# Face Recognition Attendance System — Complete Implementation Plan

---

## 1. System Overview

A **SaaS-level, multi-tenant** Face Recognition Attendance System with:
- 5 roles: Super Admin, HR, Manager, Gatekeeper, Employee
- Mobile app (React Native) with offline support
- Web admin panel (React)
- Central FastAPI server + PostgreSQL
- Face recognition via mobile camera (InsightFace/TFLite)
- Full salary engine (CTC + TDS + PF + ESI)
- Leave & gate pass approval workflow
- Push notifications, ImageKit storage

