## 4. Multi-Tenant Architecture (Company Isolation)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    SA[Super Admin] --> C1[Company A\ncompany_id=1]
    SA --> C2[Company B\ncompany_id=2]
    SA --> C3[Company C\ncompany_id=3]

    C1 --> D1[(PostgreSQL\nRow-Level Security\ncompany_id filter)]
    C2 --> D1
    C3 --> D1

    D1 --> T1[employees WHERE company_id=1]
    D1 --> T2[employees WHERE company_id=2]
```

**Isolation Strategy:**
- Every table has `company_id` column
- PostgreSQL **Row-Level Security (RLS)** enforced at DB level
- JWT token contains `company_id` + `role`
- Every API query automatically filters by `company_id` from token
- No cross-company data leakage possible

