## 8. Core Flow Diagrams

### 8.1 Face Recognition Attendance Flow (Gatekeeper)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    GK[Gatekeeper opens app] --> CAM[Open Camera]
    CAM --> CAP[Capture Face Frame]
    CAP --> DET{Face Detected?}
    DET -->|No| CAM
    DET -->|Yes| EMB[Extract Face Embedding\non device TFLite]
    EMB --> CMP[Compare with cached\nemployee embeddings]
    CMP --> SIM{Similarity > 0.6?}
    SIM -->|No| UNK[Unknown Face ❌\nShow alert]
    SIM -->|Yes| ID[Employee Identified ✅]
    ID --> CHK{Already checked\nin today?}
    CHK -->|No| CI[Mark Check-In\n+ timestamp]
    CHK -->|Yes| CO[Mark Check-Out\n+ calc OT]
    CI --> SAVE[Save to local SQLite]
    CO --> SAVE
    SAVE --> SYNC{Online?}
    SYNC -->|Yes| SERVER[Sync to Server immediately]
    SYNC -->|No| QUEUE[Queue for later sync]
    SERVER --> NOTIF[Push notification\nto Employee ✅]
    QUEUE --> LATER[Auto-sync when\nnetwork returns]
```

### 8.2 Leave Request Approval Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    EM[Employee raises\nLeave Request] --> MGR_NOTIF[Push notification\nto Manager]
    MGR_NOTIF --> MGR{Manager Decision}
    MGR -->|Reject| REJ1[Status: Rejected\nNotify Employee]
    MGR -->|Approve| HR_NOTIF[Push notification\nto HR]
    HR_NOTIF --> HR{HR Decision}
    HR -->|Reject| REJ2[Status: Rejected\nNotify Employee]
    HR -->|Approve| APR[Status: Approved\nNotify Employee]
    APR --> ATT[Mark attendance as\nLeave on those dates]
```

### 8.3 Salary Calculation Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    TRIG[HR triggers salary\ncalculation for month] --> CELERY[Celery background task]
    CELERY --> FETCH[Fetch all employees\nattendance for month]
    FETCH --> CALC[Calculate per employee]
    CALC --> SAL[Basic + HRA + DA]
    SAL --> OT[+ OT Pay\nbased on hourly rate]
    OT --> DED[- PF deduction\n- ESI deduction\n- LWP deduction]
    DED --> TDS[- TDS\nbased on annual projection]
    TDS --> NET[= Net Salary]
    NET --> DRAFT[Save as DRAFT]
    DRAFT --> HR_REV[HR reviews draft]
    HR_REV --> PUB[HR publishes]
    PUB --> NOTIF[Push notification\nto all employees]
    NOTIF --> VIEW[Employee views\npayslip in app]
```

