## 10. Offline Sync Strategy (Mobile)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Phone [📱 Mobile App]
        A[Action performed\ne.g. attendance marked] --> B[Save to WatermelonDB\nSQLite locally]
        B --> C{Network\navailable?}
        C -->|Yes| D[Sync immediately\nto server]
        C -->|No| E[Add to sync queue]
        E --> F[Background sync\nwhen network returns]
    end

    subgraph Server [🖥️ Server]
        D --> G[Validate + save\nto PostgreSQL]
        F --> G
        G --> H[Return sync status]
    end
```

**What's stored offline on phone:**
- Employee's own face embedding (for gatekeeper device)
- All company employees' embeddings (gatekeeper device only)
- Own attendance last 30 days
- Pending leave/gate pass requests
- Shift schedule
- Leave balance

