## 11. Scaling & Optimization

| Area | Strategy |
|---|---|
| **Face matching** | Redis cache all embeddings, avoid DB hit per check-in |
| **Database** | Read replicas for reports, write to primary only |
| **Salary calc** | Celery async task, not blocking API |
| **File storage** | ImageKit CDN — auto image optimization |
| **API** | FastAPI async endpoints, connection pooling (asyncpg) |
| **Multi-tenant** | PostgreSQL RLS, company_id indexed on all tables |
| **Horizontal scale** | Stateless FastAPI → multiple instances behind Nginx |
| **Monitoring** | Sentry for errors, Prometheus + Grafana for metrics |

